{"id":"055b3e50c22c8235","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-mertens.md","title":"Mertens' Theorems","display":"thm-mertens — Mertens' Theorems","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-mertens","aliases":["58-thm-mertens"],"display":"thm-mertens — Mertens' Theorems","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-mobius.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-mertens"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-mertens</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mertens — Mertens' Theorems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f40afef4d16889fd\" href=\"?note=f40afef4d16889fd\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-mobius.md\">../batch08/58-df-mobius.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\\{-1,0,1\\}\">\\(\\mu:\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\\{-1,0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f40afef4d16889fd\" href=\"?note=f40afef4d16889fd\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-mobius.md\">../batch08/58-df-mobius.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mertens\\text{-}mobius} \\vdash\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(N\\leq x\\to\n\\left|\\sum_{\\substack{n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\n\\leq x}}\\frac{\\mu(n)}n\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mertens\\text{-}mobius} \\vdash\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(N\\leq x\\to\n\\left|\\sum_{\\substack{n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\n\\leq x}}\\frac{\\mu(n)}n\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mertens\\text{-}prime\\text{-}reciprocals} \\vdash\n\\exists B_1\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(N\\leq x\\to\n\\left|\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\omega\\\\p\\leq x\\\\\\mathrm{Prime}(p)}}\\frac1p-\\log\\log x-B_1\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mertens\\text{-}prime\\text{-}reciprocals} \\vdash\n\\exists B_1\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(N\\leq x\\to\n\\left|\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\omega\\\\p\\leq x\\\\\\mathrm{Prime}(p)}}\\frac1p-\\log\\log x-B_1\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both limits are expanded by their real <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>--<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> definitions, so no undeclared limit operator is used.</li>\n<li>Mertens conjecture: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|M(x)| &lt; \\sqrt{x}\">\\(|M(x)| &lt; \\sqrt{x}\\)</span> (false: Odlyzko).</li>\n<li>Meissel–Mertens constant: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B = 0.261497\\ldots\">\\(B = 0.261497\\ldots\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Prime number theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(x) = o(x)\">\\(M(x) = o(x)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-mobius.md","status":"resolved","id":"f40afef4d16889fd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-mobius.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-mobius.md","status":"resolved","id":"f40afef4d16889fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu:\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\\{-1,0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-mobius.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu:\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\to\\{-1,0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mertens\\text{-}mobius} \\vdash\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(N\\leq x\\to\n\\left|\\sum_{\\substack{n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\n\\leq x}}\\frac{\\mu(n)}n\\right|<\\varepsilon\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mertens\\text{-}prime\\text{-}reciprocals} \\vdash\n\\exists B_1\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(N\\leq x\\to\n\\left|\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\omega\\\\p\\leq x\\\\\\mathrm{Prime}(p)}}\\frac1p-\\log\\log x-B_1\\right|<\\varepsilon\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"|M(x)| < \\sqrt{x}","display":false},{"tex":"B = 0.261497\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"M(x) = o(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-mertens.md|58-thm-mertens]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["f40afef4d16889fd"]}